  "description": "“I wonder. Will my sister pick up my used goods, or throw it in the trash?”\n\nThe cool and elegant Seo Jeong-Hu, the perfect heir of Gyeongseo Retail, is the man her sister wanted. So, to take revenge, Yun Hae-Won had a one-night stand with Seo Jeong-Hu. Or maybe she just wanted to have something to call her own. However, even from the start, she had a bad feeling about her flimsy plan. \n\n“Marriage is a binding oath that you will always be with me.”\n\nIt seems like she messed with someone she shouldn't have. Seo Jeong-hu is not a man who can be controlled. No one can stop him from taking what he wants.\n\n(Source: WEBTOONS, translated)",
